Conflicts: grommunio-web
Replaces: grommunio-web
Provides: grommunio-web
Description: Web client for Gromox (Office Unbound Web)
 Webmail, calendar, contacts and tasks client (grommunio-web), rebranded as
 "Office Unbound Web". Application tree in /usr/share/grommunio-web (compiled
 and minified from the pinned upstream tag with a locked npm tree, see the
 package SBOM), configuration in /etc/grommunio-web/config.php (conffile).
 nginx and php-fpm snippets are shipped as examples under
 /usr/share/doc/ou-grommunio-web/examples. The session cleanup timer is
 installed but not enabled.
